{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约拿书","commonName":"约拿书","title":"约拿书","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"0008d19fae71ee096b7c0300b3bb08f70bf68552f98a4321777a48f4ce2ae5b3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约拿顺服耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话二次临到约拿说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你起来！往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民宣告我所吩咐你的话。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约拿便照耶和华的话起来，往尼尼微去。这尼尼微是极大的城，有三日的路程。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约拿进城走了一日，宣告说：「再等四十日，尼尼微必倾覆了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["尼尼微人信服 神，便宣告禁食，从最大的到至小的都穿麻衣",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这信息传到尼尼微王的耳中，他就下了宝座，脱下朝服，披上麻布，坐在灰中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又使人遍告尼尼微通城，说：「王和大臣有令，人不可尝什么，牲畜、牛羊不可吃草，也不可喝水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人与牲畜都当披上麻布；人要切切求告 神。各人回头离开所行的恶道，丢弃手中的强暴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["或者 神转意后悔，不发烈怒，使我们不致灭亡，也未可知。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["于是 神察看他们的行为，见他们离开恶道，他就后悔，不把所说的灾祸降与他们了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译：披上麻布","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JON/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}